# Pier 7: the middle block's street end is 0.50 m tall. Rolling at it from the street level at 5 m/s,
# an ollie up onto it and a manual down its whole length (4.1 m), off its seawall end onto the seawall
# level (0.25 m below the top there), landed clean.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 568.85 922.23 -9.30 54.5
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 4.073
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 2.900
hold ollie 74..86
tap up 152
tap down 156
bot balance
run 330
expect event land{quality=clean} within 155..161
expect event manualStart{trick=Manual} within 155..161
expect event air within 226..234
expect event land{quality=clean} within 250..258
expect no event bail
